<title>BELGIUM: Hoelgaard to brief on BSE.</title>
<headline>Hoelgaard to brief on BSE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Monday that Lars Hoelgaard, director of DGVI for health, will comment on his hearing by the European Parliament inquiry panel on BSE on Tuedsay at 1130/1030 GMT in the Breydel news room.</p>
<p>Chief spokesman Nikolaus van der Pas had earlier implied at the Commission's midday briefing that it would be the director general of DGVI that would brief.</p>
</text>
